{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1777860423_9266287_7b8e041e8137588f12118ec33fb7dce4.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We are a Christian clothing brand for men and women that shares the Gospel through clean, stylish graphic tees designed to start conversations and point people to Christ.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• What makes us different:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We focus on high-quality, modern designs with a clear Gospel message. Our goal is to combine style and faith in a way that feels natural, bold, and meaningful.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn 15% commission through their unique link. After 5 sales, you receive a free shirt. After 20 sales, your commission increases to 20%.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• How to promote us:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Promote us however you want—content, reels, posts, or storytelling. We encourage creativity and authentic promotion that fits your style.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• Other information:</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We value faith, creativity, and consistency. Our goal is to grow together while spreading the Gospel through clothing.</span></p></div></div>",
